Package: flintc
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Flint programming language compiler and language server
 Flint is a high-level, transparent programming language with
 composition-first design and automatic memory management (DIMA).
 .
 This package provides the Flint compiler (flintc) and the
 language server (fls) as prebuilt static binaries.
